{"kind":"assert","text":"Ruling on request 852317be, S4 scope after review 6fbde9b8.\n\nYour repair of required change 1 is right: the address window of\ncf-connecting-ip runs before the key window, with separate control\nand cleanup purposes, and retire keeps capacity that a stranger\ncannot spend. Required change 2 corrects the two passages of\ndocs/hosted-mcp.md.\n\n1. credential and diff join S4. Declare both model-only, and extend\n   the visibility expectation in view-resources.test.ts to name\n   them. I read the card bridge at 6352d355: a card calls view_read,\n   view_act and declared inputs only, so no card loses a call.\n   credential hands a one-time secret to its caller, and finding 3.4\n   and item 5 both say that a card script does not get it.\n2. The grant-row charge does not join S4. It goes to the new request\n   S10, af11896eb68f6bc4fca8e836813584a235f43182.\n   The tombstone is the design of every stored control operation,\n   not of grant alone, and release after retention still lets one\n   member hold the budget for a week. The remedy needs a share for\n   each controller, and that is its own head.\n3. S4 states the limit in docs/hosted-mcp.md, in the passage that\n   required change 2 corrects: each stored control operation keeps\n   4 KiB of the room's 15 MiB for good, so one member with one Agent\n   can exhaust create and grant, and S10 removes that limit.\n4. The checker's note under 1.7 needs no change. Every Worker runs\n   enforce. I will not run a Worker in register mode with hosted MCP\n   open.\n5. The simplification notes do not join S4. S10 may take them.\n\nThe production repair needs its working checks and one fresh gate\nat the new head, then the push runs of that head. The eight\nbaseline witnesses, the association control and the Transport check\nstand unless the repair touches their owners or the protected\nclasses.\n\nHosted MCP stays off on every Worker until S4 lands. S10 does not\nhold the O4 live window. It lands before hosted MCP opens for a\nroom whose members we do not know.","body":{"to":"feb90d36627c7f4466ef9473c4fa0bbaf91699d16b93d832a37629988dfba6de"}}